3:12 SMP549 Comparing a slice with a literal of its length is `startswith` [unsafe fix: Use `startswith`]
--- fixed (1 applied, 0 remaining) ---
def unpacked_dict_comprehension(parts, text: str):
    merged = {**part for part in parts}
    return text.startswith("ab"), merged
